
= Vector World =

A retro, flat-shaded low-poly 3D world, in the style of 16-bit demos:
procedural mountains, Bayer dithering, wireframe, a day/night cycle, CRT
effects (scanlines, vignette) and a heightmap editor. Built with Three.js,
Vite and simplex-noise.

